  "description": "This is a custom-designed balisong, commonly known as a butterfly knife. The defining characteristic of this weapon is the fan-like opening of a freely pivoting blade, allowing rapid deployment or concealment. As a result, butterfly knives are outlawed in many countries. It has been spray-painted using a tangle of masking tape as a stencil.\\n\\n<i>True power is demonstrated with subtle application</i>",
